&lt;li&gt;Conduct one-on-one optimization and onboarding conversations, providing strategic recommendations on pricing, availability, and listing quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure availability over high compression dates, ensuring hosts maximize their revenue potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate hosts on product updates and policy changes, while channeling their feedback to internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
