&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is a mission-driven company dedicated to helping create a world where anyone can belong anywhere. It takes a unified team committed to our core values to achieve this goal. Airbnb&#39;s various functions embody the company&#39;s innovative spirit, and our fast-moving team is committed to leading as a 21st-century company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Internationalization Infrastructure team, part of Application Platform, builds the technology that helps Airbnb deliver high-quality experiences to guests and hosts around the world. We provide reliable, scalable, and efficient infrastructure and tooling for Airbnb code, content, and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team owns three pillars of Airbnb&#39;s internationalization platform: translation workflows that move content from authoring through translation and delivery, guardrails that protect quality and reliability, and foundational libraries that make internationalization consistent across platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help build this infrastructure, create paved paths for product teams, and enable responsible experimentation with machine learning and large language models. You will partner with Globalization, Data Science and ML, product and platform teams, content stakeholders, and external vendors to reduce friction and improve the global Airbnb experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people use Airbnb in their preferred languages every day. As an engineer on the Internationalization Infrastructure team, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build high-scale translation workflows, APIs, UIs, and libraries that provide consistent paved paths across Airbnb.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify legacy systems through safe migrations while improving reliability, observability, latency, security, and cost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype applications of machine learning and large language models, then turn validated ideas into durable platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Globalization, Data Science and ML, product and platform teams, and external vendors to solve ambiguous customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure success through outcomes such as quality, cost, latency, adoption, developer productivity, and operational load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for engineers who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work autonomously, turning broad goals and ambiguous problems into clear plans, sound decisions, and shipped outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively find high-value problems, learn directly from customers and data, and connect technical work to measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype early, especially with AI and machine learning, to test ideas, learn quickly, and invest deeply where evidence supports it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine strong distributed-systems judgment with the ability to deliver useful, intuitive full-stack experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively while taking end-to-end ownership of decisions and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as owners and stewards of Airbnb&#39;s multilingual capabilities and the long-term health of the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant industry experience with a BS or Master&#39;s degree, preferably in Computer Science, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills for hands-on individual-contributor work in Java, Kotlin, C++, or a comparable backend language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, building, and operating distributed systems, APIs, storage and caching systems, event-driven processing, or service-oriented architectures at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evolving production systems through incremental migrations, testing, observability, and operational ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with JavaScript or TypeScript and experience with React or comparable modern web technologies sufficient to own internal workflows end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating across organizational boundaries and communicating technical tradeoffs clearly to engineering and non-engineering partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-informed approach to system quality, reliability, efficiency, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-assisted development tools and agents to accelerate discovery, prototyping, implementation, testing, and documentation, with sound judgment about quality and verification. Interest in building AI-enabled platform capabilities is valued; prior ML specialization is not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for globalization, inclusive user experiences, and building infrastructure that helps teams serve a worldwide community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb values diversity &amp;amp; belonging and is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. All individuals seeking employment at Airbnb are considered without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, age, gender, sex, marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, veteran status, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, or any other legally protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$230,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt; We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process for applicants with disabilities. If you need assistance, or an accommodation, please let your recruiter know once you are contacted about a role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Recruiting Scams:&lt;/strong&gt; Scammers sometimes pose as Airbnb recruiters to get money or personal information from candidates. A few things that will always be true for Airbnb’s hiring process: our open roles are posted on Airbnb’s Career’s Page at careers.airbnb.com, and our recruiters correspond only from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://airbnb.com&quot;&gt;airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; or @&lt;a href=&quot;http://ext.airbnb.com&quot;&gt;ext.airbnb.com&lt;/a&gt; email addresses. Our recruiters will never ask for your Social Security number, bank account details, passport, or payment app information while you are interviewing.&amp;nbsp; We’ll also never ask you to pay a fee, send money, deposit or cash a check, or purchase work-related equipment (such as a company laptop) during the interview process. We encourage candidates to remain vigilant of these recruiting scams and not share sensitive information if you do not believe an individual is actually affiliated with Airbnb.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb creates opportunities for millions of hosts to build a business, develop connections with guests and hosts, and positively impact local communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The strength of the global Host community sets Airbnb apart. We keep hosts at the center of everything we do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Airbnb Community team treats hosts as partners by fostering connection, supporting their development and success, and incorporating their feedback in our product and policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Host Development Lead is an experienced leader who will drive the Community incentives and recognition strategy that shapes communications, education and engagement to accelerate host growth across their lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a balance of leadership and operational excellence to build and optimize programs that incentivize our hosts to grow through recognition and education. You will work with leadership and cross-functional partners to set strategy and evolve programs like Superhost and new programs along the host lifecycle. You will partner in the operation and continuous optimization of these programs, using data and host feedback to ensure they are inclusive and globally scalable. Initiatives may include qualification criteria, recognition milestones, benefits programs, engagement or education to incentivize actions —designed as a system to drive meaningful growth and loyalty with hosts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the strategy of Airbnb’s host community incentives, recognition and benefits programs&lt;/strong&gt; to drive meaningful host growth, positive sentiment, and loyalty with hosts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and implement &lt;/strong&gt;initiatives that deepen host quality, educate hosts on actions to strengthen their businesses, drive retention, and motivate our best hosts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate strong cross-functional relationships &lt;/strong&gt;(Product, Marketing, Data Science, Policy, Design, Customer Support, Community, Supply) to represent the host perspective and ensure incentive and education systems scale globally while adapting to local cultural contexts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive –&amp;nbsp; in partnership with Product Marketing and Business – the &lt;strong&gt;ongoing evolution of the Superhost program&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring it remains an exemplar of business impact, quality, and host recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incubate and test&lt;/strong&gt; incentive and recognition programs for new lines of business, such as Experiences and Services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define program goals and optimize program effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt; by aligning to OKRs (Objectives and key results) and continuously iterating based on data-driven insights and host feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner in end-to-end operational execution&lt;/strong&gt; of host incentive and recognition— scoping work, securing stakeholder alignment and financial viability, managing vendors, overseeing operational excellence, and delivering measurable business impact on time and on budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide clear and compelling communication&lt;/strong&gt; of program strategy, performance, and impact to cross-functional partners and senior/executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with production and marketing teams&lt;/strong&gt; to deliver&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;high-quality, on-brand programs—including recognition campaigns, benefit frameworks, badging, incentive systems, requirements policies, and supporting education.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocate for and implement creative approaches&lt;/strong&gt; to incentive design, balancing strategic rigor with innovative, engaging solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and support junior team members,&lt;/strong&gt; fostering a culture of excellence, inclusion, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior leader with 12+ years of experience in incentive and loyalty programs, Strategy, Marketing, B2B education, or a proven track record of designing and scaling loyalty/rewards systems that drive engagement, behavior change, and measurable business results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker able to zoom out to design holistic frameworks and zoom in to ensure every detail is thoughtfully executed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data and analytics acumen, including financial literacy, with experience using insights to optimize programs and demonstrate impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator, skilled at engaging diverse audiences including executive leadership and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at navigating ambiguity, influencing key partners, and aligning teams around clear priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success managing operationally complex programs in a global, matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing inclusive programs with cultural sensitivity for diverse, global audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and curiosity using LLMs/Generative AI to deepen research, accelerate work, and create prototypes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep connection to Airbnb’s mission and a passion for fostering Connection and Belonging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
